# The dash strike's lunge: 16 m/s, a moment without friction, 3 s apart. (Whoever is ahead is hit by
# its Hit motion, a node: a probe and what it does to what it finds are a tree.)

use if brawl.cd_dash <= 0
    change brawl.cd_dash = 3
    emit brawl.dash_strike.started
    impulse 16 replace horizontal
    move for 0.25 friction 0
